    "message": "test(connect-four): measure strict 48dp layout in RenderBox coordinates\n\nThe first real C4 regression run passed all 8 existing flow/visual cases,\nbut global Rect edge subtraction returned 47.99999999999997 in the four\nnew swipe fixtures. Read RenderBox.size for the unchanged strict >=48dp\nlayout assertion; retain global alignment and exposed-target checks.\n\nNo product code, game logic, workflow, Native pin or reviewed images changed.\nRecord the actual 1453 failure and original artifact without claiming Android\nor completed swipe acceptance. The next CI run must execute those checks.",
